Licenses of this repository
===========================

This repository bundles several parts and each has its own license. The one
that applies is the license of the folder the file lives in.

  app/          MIT                     Full text in app/LICENSE
  extension/    GPL-3.0-or-later        Full text in extension/LICENSE
                                        (the extension runs inside GNOME
                                        Shell, which is GPL; it follows suit)

  landing/site/assets/fonts/
                Inter                   SIL Open Font License 1.1
                                        Text: LICENSE-Inter.txt (same folder)
                Bricolage Grotesque     SIL Open Font License 1.1
                                        Text: LICENSE-Bricolage-Grotesque.txt
                                        (same folder)

  Everything else: MIT (text at the end of this file). This includes landing/
  (templates, scripts, texts and site design), docs/ (documentation),
  .github/ and the files in the repository root.

If you add a dependency or a resource with its own license (fonts, icons,
images), include its license text next to the file and add it to this list.

